  "title": "Slow Cooker Broccoli-Cheese Soup",
  "description": "A hearty, slow-cooker soup loaded with potatoes, celery, carrots, broccoli, and creamy Velveeta® cheese—perfect for a cozy, comforting one-pot meal.",
